<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Feb 26.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Feb 26.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to London Mar 111.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Mar 98.00/98.50/99.00 Apr/Jun</p>
<p>100.50/01.00/01.25/01.50</p>
<p>West Norfolk Apr 99.00 Apr/Jun 100.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Mar 98.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Mar 96.50/97.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Mar 98.00/98.50/99.00 Apr/Jun 101.00</p>
<p>Herefordshire Apr/Jun 101.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Mar 96.00</p>
